Welcome to the Royal Unova!{VAR BE01}
The scenery is exhilarating,
the battles are exciting.{VAR BE01}
The ticket is $1,000.
Would you like to get on board?

The Royal Unova leaves once a day,
only in the evening.{VAR BE00}
It is a cruiser-type passenger ship.{VAR BE01}

The Royal Unova operates only in
the evening.{VAR BE00}
Please come back again.

The ship goes under a big bridge called
Skyarrow Bridge in the Unova region,{VAR BE00}
then turns around at Marvelous Bridge{VAR BE00}
and returns to Castelia City.{VAR BE01}
We'll let you know when it's time
to leave by blowing a whistle five times.{VAR BE01}

From the deck of the world-famous Royal
Unova, you can enjoy a spectacular view.{VAR BE01}
And the passenger cabins are full of
Trainers who love to battle.{VAR BE01}
Please enjoy both the view and
the battles!{VAR BE01}
Note that as C-Gears may affect radio
signals or instruments in the ship,{VAR BE00}
we ask that you refrain from using them.{VAR BE00}
Thank you.{VAR BE01}

Thank you for sailing with us on the
Royal Unova.{VAR BE01}
Have a nice day!

Congratulations!{VAR BE01}
You've defeated all the Trainers
on the ship!{VAR BE01}
Please accept this prize.{VAR BE01}

The Royal Unova is now in preparation.{VAR BE01}
We are working very hard to ready the
ship for the best Pokémon Trainers.
